{
  "total": 72.58,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 1,
      "text": "What if I told you that stores can trick your brain with just one cent?",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.96,
      "dur": 4.96
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "text": "Sounds ridiculous, right?",
      "start": 6.4,
      "end": 7.5,
      "dur": 1.1
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "text": "But there's a reason so many prices end in 99.",
      "start": 8.04,
      "end": 11.48,
      "dur": 3.44
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "text": "Imagine you're shopping and see a shirt for $20.",
      "start": 12.36,
      "end": 15.06,
      "dur": 2.7
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "text": "Now imagine the same shirt costs $19.99.",
      "start": 15.86,
      "end": 21.3,
      "dur": 5.44
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "text": "The difference?",
      "start": 21.3,
      "end": 22.04,
      "dur": 0.74
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "text": "Just one cent.",
      "start": 22.62,
      "end": 23.78,
      "dur": 1.16
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "text": "But here's where your brain plays tricks on you.",
      "start": 24.32,
      "end": 26.78,
      "dur": 2.46
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "text": "When you see $19.99, you tend to focus on the first number.",
      "start": 26.78,
      "end": 32.36,
      "dur": 5.58
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "text": "You see 19 instead of 20.",
      "start": 32.94,
      "end": 35.32,
      "dur": 2.38
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "text": "And suddenly, the price can feel much cheaper than it actually is.",
      "start": 35.9,
      "end": 39.78,
      "dur": 3.88
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "text": "This is called psychological pricing.",
      "start": 40.94,
      "end": 43.26,
      "dur": 2.32
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "text": "Businesses have used this strategy for decades because it can influence what customers buy.",
      "start": 44.06,
      "end": 49.16,
      "dur": 5.1
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "text": "And here's the funny part.",
      "start": 50.32,
      "end": 51.58,
      "dur": 1.26
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "text": "Even when you know the trick, it can still work on you.",
      "start": 52.16,
      "end": 55.52,
      "dur": 3.36
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "text": "So next time you see something priced at $9.99...",
      "start": 55.52,
      "end": 60.66,
      "dur": 5.14
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "text": "Remember, that missing penny probably isn't there to save you money.",
      "start": 60.66,
      "end": 65.36,
      "dur": 4.7
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "text": "It's there to make you feel like you're spending less.",
      "start": 65.96,
      "end": 68.5,
      "dur": 2.54
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "text": "You didn't know that about money!",
      "start": 69.18,
      "end": 70.68,
      "dur": 1.5
    }
  ]
}